PATCH 601: the .FSG header's eight map positions are copied as dwords.

board:0017 / board:0023.  d501's tail (0xd59f-0xd5db) is eight `mov eax,[0xe988+4k] ; mov [dst],eax`:
the pair at 0x7b84/0x7b88, the pair at 0x7a38/0x7a3c, and the two reinforcement entry points at
0x943c/0x9440 and 0x9444/0x9448 that 9db1 seeds a respawned vehicle's position from.  Ghidra typed
all eight as words and the port copied the low halves: its reinforcements entered the map at
(0xa514, 0x2d68) where the original's enter at (0xfa514, 0xd2d68) -- the seeded replay's first
differing object on the second full AZER1 run (step 2321), and the DEFEAT that run ends in came a
thousand steps early.

